822	     * abbreviations are expanded to their full word ({@code ST} to {@code STREET}, {@code RD} to
823	     * {@code ROAD}, {@code AVE} to {@code AVENUE}). For example {@code "  12  main  st "} becomes
824	     * {@code "12 MAIN STREET"}. The normalized value is stored and returned, and is also the form used
